WEBVTT

00:19.370 --> 00:23.070
<i>Gokusen</i>

00:23.340 --> 00:28.570
<i>How long has it been</i>
<i>since that day when we first met?</i>

00:28.750 --> 00:34.280
<i>So many good times and bad times</i>
<i>have come and gone since then.</i>

00:34.450 --> 00:39.580
<i>I know you can't make sense</i>
<i>of what I'm trying to say.</i>

00:39.760 --> 00:45.060
<i>But my true feelings for you</i>
<i>can never be put into words.</i>

00:45.360 --> 00:50.800
<i>Will you ever know how I feel? Will you</i>
<i>ever know what's going on inside me?</i>

00:51.000 --> 00:56.440
<i>If only we could live in a world where</i>
<i>you only have to be yourself and smile.</i>

00:56.610 --> 01:01.870
<i>Or is it always going to be like this?</i>
<i>Will we be able to go on like this?</i>

01:02.080 --> 01:09.750
<i>Even if you're far away, I want to</i>
<i>feel you in my heart, close to me.</i>

01:21.800 --> 01:24.200
Shin Sawada's dropping out of school?

01:24.300 --> 01:27.630
It's all the more unfortunate
since he was such a bright student.

01:27.770 --> 01:29.260
What's going on?

01:29.370 --> 01:31.200
This is the first I've heard of it...

01:31.310 --> 01:34.300
His father was here early
this morning, to drop this off...

01:35.080 --> 01:38.050
<i>Withdrawal Notification</i>
I really have no choice but to accept this.

01:38.550 --> 01:40.350
Is his father being transferred?

01:40.450 --> 01:41.380
I don't know.

01:41.520 --> 01:43.580
He just said it was a family matter...

01:43.720 --> 01:45.480
Did Shin come here with him?

01:45.560 --> 01:47.520
Actually, his father came alone.

01:49.790 --> 01:51.560
Huh? Shin's quitting?

01:51.890 --> 01:54.860
His father wishes to
keep this matter quiet.

01:55.000 --> 01:58.130
In other words, please don't
create an uproar over this.

01:58.200 --> 01:58.960
No kidding?

01:59.070 --> 01:59.830
It's b.s.!

01:59.940 --> 02:01.300
He never told us!

02:03.510 --> 02:04.870
Ms. Yamaguchi...

02:05.110 --> 02:06.630
M-Ms. Yamaguchi!

02:07.280 --> 02:10.710
Principal, until I've had a chance to
talk to Shin personally...

02:10.850 --> 02:13.320
...could you please put
his withdrawal on hold?

02:13.420 --> 02:18.350
<i>SHIN DROPS OUT OF SCHOOL?!</i>

02:18.490 --> 02:22.190
No kidding? Why did he do that?

02:22.290 --> 02:24.490
Nobody knows why...

02:28.530 --> 02:29.520
Shin...

02:30.770 --> 02:33.200
I hope it's not because of
the other day...

02:33.640 --> 02:36.940
No, he's not the type to brood
over something like that.

02:37.040 --> 02:40.500
But it's not like him to just
drop out without telling anyone!

02:41.410 --> 02:43.380
Something must've happened.

02:43.610 --> 02:47.240
Yankumi! What's this about
Shin dropping out of school?

02:47.380 --> 02:49.380
Huh? Who told you that?

02:49.520 --> 02:50.890
The Vice Principal.

02:53.020 --> 02:54.650
So is it true, Yankumi?

02:54.790 --> 02:57.060
Shin didn't clue any of us in, you know!

02:57.160 --> 02:59.390
He didn't say a word to me, either.

03:00.900 --> 03:05.840
OK, take this test,
then show me where Shin lives.

03:06.540 --> 03:08.600
He's not at his apartment.

03:08.700 --> 03:10.330
Where the hell is he?

03:10.440 --> 03:12.470
Hey, maybe he's at his parents' place.

03:12.580 --> 03:13.470
Parents' place?

03:13.580 --> 03:15.310
Who knows where the hell that is?

03:15.410 --> 03:16.540
Well, I do.

03:16.710 --> 03:20.270
I think it's about a
15-minute walk from here.

03:20.980 --> 03:24.550
But if they're so close, why did
he leave home to be on his own?

03:24.620 --> 03:27.150
Remember I told you
about that assault charge...

03:27.290 --> 03:29.420
...they pinned on him in junior high?

03:29.560 --> 03:32.360
He'd already gotten accepted
into a prestigious high school...

03:32.460 --> 03:34.560
...but they revoked his admission
over the assault.

03:34.660 --> 03:36.760
And so he ended up at Shirokin.

03:36.930 --> 03:39.840
Against his parents' wishes,
from what I know.

03:39.940 --> 03:42.130
He got into a huge fight with his dad...

03:42.270 --> 03:44.930
...so he left home when he started
going to Shirokin.

03:45.040 --> 03:46.670
So that's his story...

03:47.010 --> 03:49.880
Shin's dad is super-strict,
you know...

03:51.950 --> 03:54.010
Don't tell me, this is it?

03:54.250 --> 03:55.220
That's right.

03:55.620 --> 03:57.210
It's huge!

04:01.220 --> 04:04.220
Uh, his dad wouldn't be home
this time of day, right?

04:04.330 --> 04:06.690
Come on, how much of a
badass can Shin's dad be?

04:06.800 --> 04:08.200
He's a serious badass, man.

04:08.300 --> 04:09.320
Outa my way!

04:10.000 --> 04:12.590
For chrissake, you're pissing
your pants over somebody's dad!

04:12.740 --> 04:14.000
Yeah, but listen...

04:14.540 --> 04:16.510
Don't you know his dad is some hotshot...

04:16.640 --> 04:18.160
...at the Police Department?

04:18.270 --> 04:19.400
Hmm...

04:20.840 --> 04:21.330
Huh?

04:21.440 --> 04:22.410
For real?

04:23.110 --> 04:27.110
I think he's the chief of police, or
the commissioner, or something like that.

04:27.220 --> 04:29.050
H-Holy crap...not the pigs!

04:29.190 --> 04:30.180
Hey, Yankumi!

04:30.320 --> 04:32.580
What the hell are you doing
backing off like that?

04:32.690 --> 04:35.620
Oh, uh, I just remembered
I had an emergency!

04:35.730 --> 04:37.190
I'll come back another time!

04:37.330 --> 04:38.390
Augh!

04:43.570 --> 04:45.360
Don't tell me...

04:45.770 --> 04:49.070
Who are you people?
May I ask what you're doing here?

04:49.170 --> 04:52.010
Oh, no, sir! We were just passing by!

04:52.780 --> 04:53.900
Is that right?

04:54.040 --> 04:56.010
Those are Shirokin students, aren't they?

04:56.110 --> 04:56.580
Yes.

04:56.680 --> 04:59.080
You're wasting your time
if you've come to see Shin.

04:59.180 --> 05:01.780
Shin no longer has any business with you.

05:02.320 --> 05:04.010
I must ask you to leave.

05:04.820 --> 05:07.090
Hey, hey! Please wait a minute!

05:07.760 --> 05:08.950
What is it?

05:09.630 --> 05:12.090
I'm a teacher at Shirokin High.

05:12.190 --> 05:14.660
I'm Shin's homeroom teacher, Yamaguchi.

05:14.760 --> 05:15.750
Teacher?

05:16.500 --> 05:19.470
I'd like to speak with him.
May I see him?

05:19.570 --> 05:21.090
I don't see the point.

05:21.200 --> 05:24.500
I really can't have you causing
any trouble for my son.

05:24.710 --> 05:26.700
I won't take up too much of his time.

05:26.810 --> 05:29.710
Surely there'd be no harm in that?

05:31.480 --> 05:34.080
All right,
I'll allow you alone to see him.

05:34.220 --> 05:36.690
But no longer than 5 minutes.

05:43.290 --> 05:45.490
Can you believe that?

06:02.610 --> 06:03.600
Yamaguchi!

06:03.750 --> 06:06.720
I can see they really
did a number on you.

06:07.020 --> 06:09.780
There's a whole army
of guards out there.

06:11.250 --> 06:12.620
But I don't get it...

06:12.760 --> 06:15.750
How come you're being
confined in your own home?

06:16.090 --> 06:18.490
Because my brother ran off, that's why.

06:18.630 --> 06:22.160
My older brother, who was
the perfect son all his life.

06:22.670 --> 06:24.460
What are you talking about?

06:24.630 --> 06:28.330
Everyone was sure he'd follow in
my dad's footsteps after college.

06:28.470 --> 06:32.310
But he dropped out of school
all of a sudden and took off somewhere.

06:32.410 --> 06:35.380
Says there's something else
he wants to do...

06:35.540 --> 06:39.410
Well, that can't be helped, it's your
brother's life. Same goes for you too...

06:39.520 --> 06:42.310
Out of the blue,
he tells me to transfer out...

06:42.550 --> 06:45.650
Looks like he wants me to
take my brother's place.

06:45.890 --> 06:48.220
You've got one selfish father.

06:50.690 --> 06:53.160
Here, that's the test we had today.

06:53.300 --> 06:56.090
I have no way of grading you,
so jot down the answers, will you?

06:56.200 --> 06:59.600
I don't need a grade.
What's the point, anyway?

06:59.700 --> 07:01.170
So you're okay with this?

07:01.270 --> 07:02.830
My dad's dead serious.

07:02.940 --> 07:04.300
I can't defy him.

07:06.480 --> 07:08.440
Miss? Time's almost up...

07:09.750 --> 07:12.210
I'm not going to butt in anymore.

07:12.350 --> 07:15.320
As long as you've made up
your own mind as a man...

07:26.260 --> 07:27.490
Ms. Yamaguchi?

07:30.070 --> 07:32.970
I don't know what Shin told you,
but believe me...

07:33.100 --> 07:35.200
...it will be better for him this way.

07:35.640 --> 07:39.730
But you can't keep him under lock and key
for the rest of his life, can you?

07:40.010 --> 07:43.210
There's nothing to worry about.
That boy's no fool.

07:43.410 --> 07:47.040
I'm sure if I give him time to
come to his senses, he'll realize...

07:47.150 --> 07:48.450
...what's best for him.

07:48.580 --> 07:49.710
Well now...

07:49.890 --> 07:52.150
...we'll have to see about that, won't we?

07:52.350 --> 07:54.350
What's that supposed to mean?

07:54.460 --> 07:57.430
I apologize for intruding.

08:00.730 --> 08:01.490
Hey!

08:02.870 --> 08:03.920
Yankumi!

08:09.040 --> 08:11.370
Shin...
Is he all right?

08:11.510 --> 08:14.000
What's with that scowl on your face?

08:19.820 --> 08:24.190
"As long as you've made up
your own mind as a man", huh?

08:26.660 --> 08:28.820
There she goes again!

08:30.490 --> 08:31.520
Huh?

08:31.690 --> 08:34.100
So he's got Shin locked up?

08:34.200 --> 08:35.690
He didn't come out and say it...

08:35.800 --> 08:38.200
...but it looks like he tried
to bust out more than once.

08:38.300 --> 08:40.270
Dammit, what an asshole!

08:40.840 --> 08:41.740
Kuma...

08:41.870 --> 08:45.170
Since we were kids, Shin couldn't
stand to see anyone getting bullied...

08:45.270 --> 08:47.800
So he'd always get mixed up in fights.

08:48.110 --> 08:51.210
When he hit that teacher in junior high...
it was to defend his friend...

08:51.310 --> 08:55.940
But his father never gave him a chance
to explain, just gave him hell for it!

08:56.090 --> 08:58.820
He's got a lot of nerve!
That selfish bastard!

08:58.890 --> 08:59.650
OK!

08:59.860 --> 09:02.220
Come on, let's get
Shin out of there now!

09:02.360 --> 09:05.590
What are you talking about?
Didn't you see all those guards?

09:05.690 --> 09:07.360
You'll be caught in no time.

09:07.460 --> 09:09.400
If that happens,
I've got a nice strategy...

09:09.500 --> 09:11.930
Forget it! You don't
stand a chance against him.

09:12.030 --> 09:13.060
Yankumi...

09:13.170 --> 09:14.600
What's up your ass, anyway?

09:14.700 --> 09:18.110
You're the one who always leads
the charge in these situations!

09:18.840 --> 09:22.070
Fine! Never mind!
We'll just do it without you!

09:22.510 --> 09:24.410
Cut the crap right now!

09:25.150 --> 09:28.120
Do you want to get your
asses shipped off to juvie?

09:29.850 --> 09:32.790
You're just gonna have to give it up.

09:39.360 --> 09:42.590
Juvenile Hall, huh?
Would they really do that?

09:42.700 --> 09:43.630
Maybe.

09:43.730 --> 09:46.030
We'd be up against the cops...

09:46.740 --> 09:49.710
I guess it would be too risky, huh?

09:49.940 --> 09:52.430
Hey, hold up, guys! Just think about it!

09:52.540 --> 09:55.340
If Shin were in our place,
what do you think he'd do?

09:56.280 --> 09:59.150
He'd come to help us no matter what,
isn't that right?

09:59.250 --> 10:00.180
Minami!

10:00.450 --> 10:02.850
For once, you said something inspiring.

10:04.050 --> 10:05.950
Then, does that mean...

10:06.060 --> 10:07.520
Absolutely! Let's do it!

10:07.620 --> 10:08.520
Right!

10:46.360 --> 10:48.660
Ojou, what's the matter?

10:49.030 --> 10:49.930
Kyo...

10:50.030 --> 10:52.870
Is there something on your mind?

10:52.970 --> 10:56.700
If there is, you know
you can tell me anything!

10:57.310 --> 10:59.870
I just don't understand it...

11:00.010 --> 11:04.540
Aren't parents supposed to put their
children's happiness before anything else?

11:04.650 --> 11:07.620
Well, I suppose they do in most cases.

11:08.150 --> 11:09.520
The thing is...

11:09.650 --> 11:14.490
What the parents want for their children,
and what makes their children happy...

11:14.590 --> 11:16.820
...they're not always the same thing.

11:17.760 --> 11:19.390
That's what I think.

11:20.460 --> 11:21.520
I see.

11:22.060 --> 11:24.400
So that's the problem, huh?

11:25.100 --> 11:28.130
Ojou! You've got a call from the police!

11:28.240 --> 11:30.100
Huh! Those kids!

11:30.470 --> 11:32.440
<i>SHIROKIN POLICE STATION</i>

11:37.750 --> 11:39.810
What the hell happened to you?

11:39.920 --> 11:42.280
More importantly,
what's Tsuruta doing here, too?

11:42.350 --> 11:44.010
So it's you again?

11:44.520 --> 11:47.650
These boys were caught
trespassing on private property.

11:47.760 --> 11:49.750
They were subdued by the guards.

11:49.860 --> 11:53.190
Is that any reason to kick
the crap out of kids this age?

11:53.300 --> 11:54.960
Look here, ma'am.

11:55.700 --> 11:58.830
They could easily be charged
with attempted robbery, you know.

11:58.970 --> 11:59.990
Robbery?

12:00.440 --> 12:03.030
But their friend lives
in that same house!

12:03.140 --> 12:06.670
We were told that these kids
were unknown to them.

12:06.780 --> 12:09.800
Oh, gimme a break!
All you have to do is look into it and...

12:09.910 --> 12:11.380
Oh, I get it!

12:12.180 --> 12:14.450
You're under orders
from above, is that it?

12:14.520 --> 12:16.180
What's that supposed to mean?

12:16.320 --> 12:20.880
They aren't looking to file a complaint.
Just to let them off with a warning.

12:21.220 --> 12:23.350
Go on, get them out of here!

12:25.160 --> 12:26.790
All right, then...

12:27.460 --> 12:29.960
You little dumbass morons!

12:30.530 --> 12:34.440
Is that part of your "nice strategy"?
Getting Tsuruta involved as well?

12:34.540 --> 12:36.130
You're choking me!

12:36.240 --> 12:39.270
Yankumi. This is from Shin.

12:42.310 --> 12:43.780
<i>SHIN SAWADA</i>

12:45.780 --> 12:48.680
Never mind. Get your butts home now.

12:48.820 --> 12:51.380
But we have to do something,
or Shin will...

12:51.520 --> 12:52.680
I know that.

12:53.620 --> 12:56.290
You guys can leave Shin to me.

13:05.500 --> 13:08.940
You're not planning to ride off
into war alone, are you?

13:09.070 --> 13:10.130
Kyo...

13:10.310 --> 13:15.570
All I have to do is look at you to
know that you're up to something.

13:16.310 --> 13:19.180
Kyo, just this once,
please don't ask.

13:19.280 --> 13:21.180
It's a little messed up, see.

13:21.280 --> 13:23.150
It's not your ordinary skirmish.

13:23.220 --> 13:24.650
That's all right.

13:25.790 --> 13:28.820
One way or another,
I'm not going to let you go alone.

13:28.960 --> 13:30.190
Kyo!

13:32.290 --> 13:34.200
What the hell?

13:34.300 --> 13:39.100
You mean that redheaded kid
has a father that dangerous?

13:39.400 --> 13:40.990
Well, now you know.

13:41.100 --> 13:43.830
If I'm not careful,
it won't be good for the Clan.

13:43.940 --> 13:47.070
You're our Underboss.
I can't get you involved, see?

13:47.680 --> 13:49.980
I understand the situation.

13:50.110 --> 13:51.580
But Ojou...

13:51.680 --> 13:55.710
If your plan backfires, it'll mean the
end of your teaching operation, am I right?

13:56.120 --> 13:57.020
Probably.

13:57.120 --> 14:00.420
But you're still going to risk
everything to help that kid?

14:00.720 --> 14:03.520
One of my own students
is in need of my help.

14:03.630 --> 14:05.590
I'm not going to forsake him.

14:06.160 --> 14:07.290
Is that right?

14:07.400 --> 14:10.230
If that's your decision, Ojou,
then I'm coming with you.

14:10.330 --> 14:11.530
But Kyo, I just said...

14:11.630 --> 14:12.460
Hey!

14:12.800 --> 14:16.430
I know you guys have been standing
there listening! Come here!

14:17.210 --> 14:17.970
Ojou...

14:18.370 --> 14:19.470
Guys...

14:19.880 --> 14:21.210
We're going, too!

14:21.310 --> 14:23.710
Please allow me to come along as well!

14:24.150 --> 14:28.170
No, forget it!
I'm leaving this with you guys.

14:28.320 --> 14:30.380
But that's...

14:30.690 --> 14:32.850
Your Initiation Cup!

14:35.220 --> 14:40.630
If our plan falls through, I'm going to take
the fall alone while Ojou escapes...

14:40.860 --> 14:44.930
If that happens, I want you to
return this cup to the Kumicho!

14:45.030 --> 14:46.090
Number Two!

14:46.200 --> 14:47.640
Big Brother Kyotaro!

14:47.740 --> 14:50.540
When the cops come
around asking about me...

14:50.640 --> 14:53.770
...you tell them there's
no one by that name here!

14:54.240 --> 14:56.710
That the Ooedo Clan knows nothing...

14:56.880 --> 14:58.710
...absolutely nothing...

14:58.880 --> 15:00.710
...of that fool, Kyotaro Oshima...

15:01.250 --> 15:04.810
...you tell the cops that!

15:12.030 --> 15:13.690
Let's go already.

15:24.410 --> 15:25.810
Huh? Who's there?

15:25.910 --> 15:27.040
It's me!

15:27.580 --> 15:29.670
Kyotaro Oshima is here!

15:30.710 --> 15:31.770
What's going on?

15:31.880 --> 15:32.440
Huh?

15:34.050 --> 15:35.280
Who the hell are you?

15:36.620 --> 15:39.650
I have nothing against
you people personally...

15:39.790 --> 15:41.850
...but there's something that I must do.

15:41.960 --> 15:43.150
What did you say?

15:43.260 --> 15:45.590
If you insist on getting in my way...

15:45.690 --> 15:46.320
Damn you!

15:48.330 --> 15:51.270
I'll have to ask you
to take a little nap.

15:51.500 --> 15:52.330
Ojou...

15:52.430 --> 15:54.990
That's the line I wanted to say...

16:18.890 --> 16:20.290
Yamaguchi!

16:20.530 --> 16:24.560
Hey, we've got this backwards, haven't we?

16:25.530 --> 16:27.130
A man and a woman...

16:28.640 --> 16:30.770
This isn't the time for bad jokes!

16:30.910 --> 16:33.240
What? Shin's been abducted?

16:33.380 --> 16:35.170
We're terribly sorry!

16:35.280 --> 16:37.250
They were both skilled fighters...

16:37.350 --> 16:40.750
One was a yakuza-type male,
the other was a female.

16:41.150 --> 16:43.450
We'll launch an immediate search, sir!

16:43.990 --> 16:45.720
No, that won't be necessary.

16:46.190 --> 16:47.050
But, sir!

16:47.160 --> 16:49.220
You said one was a woman, didn't you?

16:49.320 --> 16:49.950
Yes, sir!

16:50.560 --> 16:53.150
Then I have an idea who the perp is.

16:58.530 --> 17:01.470
So we meet again, Ms. Yamaguchi.

17:01.900 --> 17:03.900
But I must say I am taken aback.

17:04.010 --> 17:08.310
Who would've guessed that my son's
homeroom teacher was a yakuza heiress...

17:08.440 --> 17:12.970
I'm told that the Ooedo Clan
has quite a long history.

17:13.120 --> 17:15.710
Why would the heiress
of such a Clan choose...

17:15.850 --> 17:18.580
...to become a high school teacher,
of all things?

17:18.820 --> 17:21.310
You surprise me, too, Mr. Sawada.

17:22.060 --> 17:24.960
Here you are,
the Police Commissioner himself...

17:25.060 --> 17:26.960
Who would've guessed...

17:27.030 --> 17:30.000
...you'd go to such great lengths
to take your son back home?

17:30.130 --> 17:32.830
I know that my son is here.

17:33.000 --> 17:36.800
I also know that you're hiding
your true identity from the school.

17:36.940 --> 17:38.410
Are you threatening me?

17:38.510 --> 17:40.200
If I revealed who you really are...

17:40.310 --> 17:43.180
...there's no way that you'd be
able to continue as a teacher!

17:43.280 --> 17:45.350
What did you say, you scum?

17:44.450 --> 17:45.350
Kyo!

17:45.450 --> 17:47.610
Over my dead body, you got that?

17:47.680 --> 17:49.520
It's all right, Kyo. That's enough!

17:49.580 --> 17:50.640
But...

17:50.790 --> 17:51.810
It's all right.

17:51.950 --> 17:56.120
The moment I decided to go help Shin,
I knew this was going to happen.

17:56.220 --> 17:57.320
Ojou...

17:58.630 --> 17:59.820
Even so...

18:00.500 --> 18:03.120
...I knew that if I let him
drop out of school...

18:03.330 --> 18:06.830
...I'd regret it for the rest of my life,
even if I did continue teaching.

18:07.540 --> 18:09.200
So go right ahead, Mr. Sawada.

18:09.300 --> 18:11.570
If you want to unmask me, unmask away!

18:11.940 --> 18:12.930
I see.

18:13.040 --> 18:14.700
Just as the local chief told me...

18:14.810 --> 18:17.780
...there's no quick and easy way
to get my way with you.

18:17.880 --> 18:21.080
But let me tell you something.
It would be nothing for me to destroy...

18:21.150 --> 18:22.280
...a clan like yours!

18:22.420 --> 18:22.910
Huh?

18:23.020 --> 18:26.180
Needless to say, your Kumicho
would not escape culpability either.

18:26.250 --> 18:26.910
What the...

18:27.020 --> 18:29.580
My grandfather has
nothing to do with this!

18:29.890 --> 18:34.520
And even if he's a yakuza, my grandfather
is still a better man than you!

18:34.760 --> 18:38.360
You asked why I'm teaching math
when I'm the heir to the Clan...

18:38.670 --> 18:41.030
Well, unlike you,
my grandfather doesn't shove...

18:41.140 --> 18:44.370
...his own lifestyle down his
children's throats, that's why!

18:49.950 --> 18:51.110
What's going on?

18:51.210 --> 18:52.040
Grandfather!

18:52.150 --> 18:55.910
What has that tomboy granddaughter
of mine done now?

18:55.980 --> 18:59.250
These days, she treats me
like I'm ancient...

18:59.390 --> 19:02.120
She never tells me anything!

19:02.220 --> 19:05.750
I don't know what's going on,
but if she's being this assertive...

19:05.860 --> 19:08.630
...then I rather doubt she's wrong.

19:08.900 --> 19:12.860
You seem to have a great deal
of trust in your granddaughter.

19:13.470 --> 19:15.160
Mr. Sawada, was it?

19:15.670 --> 19:20.010
If your child decides to do something,
dangerous though it may be...

19:20.140 --> 19:24.200
...isn't it the parent's job to
trust them to come out of it safely?

19:24.610 --> 19:26.950
Do you realize the position you're...

19:27.120 --> 19:30.810
I, Ryuichi Kuroda,
I won't run, and I won't hide!

19:30.920 --> 19:34.080
Crack down on us, annihilate us,
do whatever the hell you want!

19:34.190 --> 19:35.750
Just get the hell out of here!

19:41.030 --> 19:43.830
Very impressive,
as expected, Mr. Kuroda...

19:43.930 --> 19:47.460
But if that's how it's going to be,
you should prepare for the worst.

19:47.570 --> 19:50.330
I'll be back after I've gotten
all my documents together.

19:50.740 --> 19:51.760
Wait a minute!

19:52.810 --> 19:55.780
Aren't you embarrassed,
pulling something like this?

19:56.040 --> 19:58.950
Flaunting your authority
just to serve your own needs!

19:59.050 --> 20:02.140
Stop embarrassing me
in front of these people!

20:02.650 --> 20:04.210
You idiot.

20:04.590 --> 20:07.680
Don't tell me you're planning
to become a yakuza?

20:10.890 --> 20:14.490
Please, Dad!
Let me graduate from Shirokin High!

20:14.760 --> 20:15.730
Shin!

20:16.360 --> 20:18.630
Why are you so attached to that school?

20:18.730 --> 20:21.730
It's just a loser school
for academic failures!

20:22.540 --> 20:25.060
That's what I thought, too... at first.

20:25.170 --> 20:27.370
I chose to go there just to spite you...

20:27.480 --> 20:31.570
...for trying to cover up what I did
to that teacher in junior high.

20:32.450 --> 20:35.910
But now, it's more important
to me than anything else!

20:36.050 --> 20:37.780
I just don't want to leave!

20:37.850 --> 20:40.480
I've got friends there and...

20:41.860 --> 20:44.490
...the teachers aren't so bad either.

20:44.860 --> 20:46.090
So please...

20:46.530 --> 20:48.330
Please, let me stay!

20:48.630 --> 20:50.600
What ridiculous sentiment!

20:51.370 --> 20:54.340
I was jealous of my brother
when I was a kid.

20:54.740 --> 20:59.200
That's why I used to work my
butt off, just to impress you.

21:00.340 --> 21:03.110
But now I want to make up my own mind!

21:03.910 --> 21:05.110
Shin.

21:05.710 --> 21:08.050
Because I'm a man, too.

21:09.680 --> 21:11.550
You're an idiot...

21:24.670 --> 21:27.970
Um, I apologize for causing you
so much trouble.

21:28.100 --> 21:30.600
No need to apologize, son.

21:31.770 --> 21:33.300
I should go, then.

21:33.440 --> 21:35.100
Hey! Shin Sawada!

21:37.450 --> 21:38.610
You're the man!

21:38.710 --> 21:42.580
If I were to grade you on your performance
today, you'd get a perfect score!

21:46.520 --> 21:48.180
Damn right I would!

22:07.380 --> 22:17.370
<i>We are all born</i>
<i>crying out to the world.</i>

22:18.390 --> 22:28.350
<i>Because of all the endless grief</i>
<i>that we must go through in life.</i>

22:29.130 --> 22:38.840
<i>All of the heartache</i>
<i>is such a heavy load to bear.</i>

22:39.140 --> 22:44.040
<i>On those days when</i>
<i>I am alone and cold...</i>

22:44.280 --> 22:49.180
<i>...I'll light a fire with</i>
<i>my own two hands.</i>

22:49.620 --> 22:54.560
<i>The treacherous mountains</i>
<i>are my chosen path.</i>

22:54.720 --> 23:01.490
<i>I'll keep moving forward</i>
<i>without a backward glance.</i>

23:17.450 --> 23:23.540
Ojou! Kudos to that
young redheaded fellow!

23:23.720 --> 23:28.490
At the end of the day, you've got
to settle your own affairs yourself.

23:28.590 --> 23:29.250
Huh?

23:29.320 --> 23:32.760
Isn't that man over there
the principal of your school...

23:32.860 --> 23:36.350
WHAAAT? There's TWO of him?

23:36.460 --> 23:39.430
What in blue blazes in going on here?

23:39.530 --> 23:42.770
Next episode: Shirokin High Closing?

23:42.870 --> 23:45.840
This one's a doozy!
